<deviceset name="WE-PD2_5848" urn="urn:adsk.eagle:component:14283712/4" prefix="L">
<description>WE-PD2 SMT Power Inductor

Characteristics
Open size
Saturation currents up to 14 A
Low tolerances at high inductance values
Operating temperature: –40 °C to +125 °C
Recommended solder profile: Reflow

Applications
Switching regulators with low operating voltages (graphic cards, embedded PC-Cards, mainboards)
Integrated DC/DC converter
Optimal attenuation in MHz frequency range

Details see: www.we-online.com/components/products/WE-PD2

Updated by Ella 2025-03-11
2025 (C) Würth Elektronik</description>
